{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>明年4月於美國加州舉行的大型戶外音樂盛事《Coachella音樂節》公布表演名單，與占士邦繼任人大熱英國男星Callum Turner今年拉埋天窗的英國女歌手Dua Lipa、美國女歌手SZA、波多黎各男歌手Daddy Yankee與澳洲樂隊Tame Impala擔任壓軸嘉賓，其他參與者還有美國天后麥當娜（Madonna）、韓國女團BLACK PINK成員Jisoo等，風格夠多元化。Jisoo早於2019年以BLACK PINK名義於《Coachella音樂節》表演，更於2023年成為音樂節首個亞洲壓軸嘉賓。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:35:00.224561+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":265,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:41:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T00:39:56.345308+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:28:25.226194+00:00","content_hash":"b44dd89c701ef9713aaa2d6ad83b8b410e0138bb70cbfcd92e8b4f669063daed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:35:00.224561+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}